<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Radio reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Radio reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston analysts Harry DeMott and Brendan Maher said they reinstated coverage of American Radio Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- In a research note, they set an 18-month price target of $50.</p>
<p>-- cited clearance of merger with EZ Communications Inc, and said company has &quot;one of the highest average revenue shares and greatest percentage of underdeveloped stations in industry&quot;.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/2 to 33-1/8.</p>
</text>
